*1 [[Malevolent Mohawk Cat]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~46.67 seconds<sup>600f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Malevolent Lion Cat]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Malevolent Flying Cat]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*12 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Malevolent Dark Cat]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Malevolent Lion Cat]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
