==Trivia==
*Heinous Road appears to be a mistranslation. Its Japanese name (極悪非道 ''Gokuaku Hidō'') is a four-kanji set phrase that refers to extreme evil and roughly translates to "Malevolent Cruelty", but the word 非道 ''hidō'' (cruelty; inhumanity) contains 道, the kanji for "path", "way" or "road", which seems to be where the "Road" in the stage's English name comes from.

